    "name":  "8W LED Bulbs Filament  E27 A60",
    "reference":  "A60FM8W-90916-27K-100",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThis A60 Filament bulb has a power of 8W and an E27 socket. You can easily replace your conventional, incandescent and carbon bulbs, and thanks to its LED technology reduce your electricity consumption while maintaining a classic design.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eLED Filament Bulb 8W E27 A60\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis LED Filament bulb has an E27 socket and has 8W of power. It provides warm atmospheres\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt allows you to save on your energy consumption thanks to its LED technology, as well as maintenance and replacement costs. You will respect the environment without giving up the classic design of conventional bulbs. It also has a light output of 100lm/W.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is a multipurpose bulb as you can use it both in your home and in your workplace, creating original atmospheres with a retro touch without forgetting our 2-year guarantee.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eUses of the 8W E27 A60 LED Filament Bulb\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDecorative lighting\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRestaurants\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHotels\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRooms\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDesk or bedside lamps\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLiving rooms\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChillout\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e",
